msgstr "Claude Code {#claude-code}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install using the [plugin marketplace](https://code.claude.com/docs/en/discover-plugins#add-from-github):\n"
msgstr "Installiere über den [Plugin-Marktplatz](https://code.claude.com/docs/en/discover-plugins#add-from-github):\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Codex {#codex}"
msgstr "Codex {#codex}"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cursor {#cursor}"
msgstr "Cursor {#cursor}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from the Cursor marketplace if available, or use the [Skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills) above with `--agent cursor`. See [Cursor plugins docs](https://cursor.com/docs/plugins) for more information.\n"
msgstr "Installiere über den Cursor-Marktplatz, falls verfügbar, oder verwende das [Skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills) von oben mit `--agent cursor`. Weitere Informationen findest du in der [Cursor-Plugin-Dokumentation](https://cursor.com/docs/plugins).\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Bob {#ibm-bob}"
msgstr "IBM Bob {#ibm-bob}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bob has no plugin/marketplace step — it reads `SKILL.md` files directly from `.bob/skills/` in a cloned project. The repository symlinks the skills to `.bob/skills/<name>`  so cloning the repo is sufficient.\n"
msgstr "Bob hat keinen Plugin-/Marktplatz-Schritt — es liest `SKILL.md`-Dateien direkt aus `.bob/skills/` in einem geklonten Projekt. Das Repository verlinkt die Skills per Symlink nach `.bob/skills/<name>`, daher genügt es, das Repository zu klonen.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can also install with the [Skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills) above with `--agent bob`.\n"
msgstr "Du kannst auch mit dem [Skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills) von oben mit `--agent bob` installieren.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Clone / Copy {#clone--copy}"
msgstr "Klonen / Kopieren {#clone--copy}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If your agent does not support a native plugin or the skills CLI, clone this repo and copy the desired skill directory to the agent's supported skill directory:\n"
msgstr "Wenn dein Agent weder ein natives Plugin noch das skills CLI unterstützt, klone dieses Repository und kopiere das gewünschte Skill-Verzeichnis in das vom Agenten unterstützte Skill-Verzeichnis:\n"

